            if field not in data or not isinstance(data[field], str) or data[field].strip() == '':
                # Actually the requirement says "not empty" - I need to be careful. It says "required, not empty". Let me check if whitespace-only counts as empty. I'll treat empty string as invalid but maybe whitespace is okay? The spec says "not empty" which typically means length > 0. Let me just check for non-empty string.
